realm-fsod-{1,2,3}.wmap: private-server layouts, not authenticated official maps.
Source: wServer/realm/worlds/maps/world{1,2,3}.wmap at:
https://github.com/ossimc82/fabiano-swagger-of-doom/tree/6fd20aad4a7905b13f25389c68368a942a2b68cb

Reproduce with python3 scripts/import-realm-maps.py. Source Git blobs are
pinned in that script. Conversion removes only unused per-cell elevation;
grounds, objects, configurations, terrain and regions are retained. Runtime
replaces arrival markers and clears four connected coastal 3x3 pads, then
applies this server's bounded population and authored setpieces.

